	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. et foelix novi anni auspicium a summo atque unico rerum parente per Iesum Christum.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div2" corresp="regest2">
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z2"/>Ad proximas tuas,<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Nicht erhalten.</note> <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName> frater venerande, iniquitas temporum et occupationes <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>tristissime respondere me non sivere.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Scripsi autem domino <persName ref="p8055">Ambrosio</persName><note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2"><persName ref="p8055">Ambrosius Blarer</persName>. -Nicht in <hi>Blarer BW.</hi></note> <placeName ref="l822">Germanice</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>et petii, ut tibi meas transmitteret, quę calamitatem nostram continebant.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z5"/>Spero etiam te eas accepisse.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Sin minus, scito <placeName ref="l513">Ulmenses</placeName>,<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">Zu <placeName ref="l513">Ulms</placeName> Ergebung s. <ref target="file12783">Nr. 2734</ref>, Anm. 4.</note> <placeName ref="l320">Memingenses</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z6"/><placeName ref="l45">Bibracenses</placeName>, <placeName ref="l907">Campidonenses</placeName> a nobis penitus defecisse,<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Seit Anfang Januar stand <placeName ref="l320">Memmingen</placeName> in Verhandlungen mit Kaiser <persName ref="p18538">Karl V.</persName>; s. <bibl source="b21">HBBW XVIII</bibl> 431, Anm. 15. Die Gesandten von <placeName ref="l45">Biberach</placeName>, <placeName ref="l234">Isny</placeName>, <placeName ref="l907">Kempten</placeName>, <placeName ref="l320">Memmingen</placeName> und <placeName ref="l409">Ravensburg</placeName>, die sich in <placeName ref="l513">Ulm</placeName> versammelt hatten (s. dazu <ref target="file12806">Nr. 2757</ref>, Anm. 26), brachen am 10. Januar von dort nach <placeName ref="l1324">Heilbronn</placeName> auf, wo sie am 13. eintrafen und am 16. dem Kaiser den Fußfall leisteten; s. <hi>Rommel, Ulm</hi> 85f; [Christian Friedrich <hi>Essich,]</hi> Geschichte der Reformation zu Biberach vom Jahr 1517 bis zum Jahr 1650, Ulm 1817, S. 54; <bibl source="b473">Otto</bibl> <hi>Erhard,</hi> Die Reformation der Kirche in Kempten auf Grund archivalischer Studien, Kempten [1917], S. 50f. Am 25. Januar (am Tag der Ankunft des Kaisers in <placeName ref="l513">Ulm</placeName>; s. <ref target="file12803">Nr. 2754</ref>, Anm. 18) huldigten diese fünf Städte dem Kaiser in <placeName ref="l513">Ulm</placeName>; s. Karl <hi>Wolfart,</hi> Kaiser Karl V. und Lindau, in: Schriften des Vereins für Geschichte des Bodensees und seiner Umgebung 39, 1910, 14f, Nr. VII; Zürich StA, A 177, Nr. 164 (der <placeName ref="l257">Konstanzer</placeName> Rat an den <placeName ref="l587">Zürcher</placeName> Rat, 26. Januar 1547); Zürich StA, A 177, Nr. 167 (undatierter Bericht eines Spions an <placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName>, in dem die Huldigungszeremonie beschrieben wird).</note> nosque modo undiquaque<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">von allen Seiten; vgl. <bibl source="b316">Hoven</bibl> 594.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>hostibus esse vallatos.<pb type="edition" next="87"/></s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div3" corresp="regest3">
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Cogitatur iam apud nos de transactione sive potius <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>turpi dedicione, qualem <placeName ref="l513">Ulmenses</placeName> invenerunt.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Primores nostri omnem <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>exuerunt virilitatem, precipue vero is, cui tua sacrosancta dedicasti.<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6"><persName ref="p3927">Hans Welser</persName>, <placeName ref="l18">Augsburger</placeName> Bürgermeister, dem <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> im August 1546 seinen Lukaskommentar gewidmet hatte; s. <bibl source="b20">HBBW XVII</bibl>, <ref target="file12592">Nr. 2545</ref>.</note></s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z10"/>Senatus vero et populus iugum fortiter recusat.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Hinc timendum erit, <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>ne ex contrariis consultationibus tumultus oriatur.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div4" corresp="regest4">
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Ego me domino <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>obtuli sperans ex tribulationibus his victoriam.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Tu ora dominum fideliter, <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>ne nos deserat.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Obtestor quoque te per mutuam dilectionem, ut, quid in <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>his turbis, quas neque prohibere neque diu ferre possum, faciundum <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>sit, in scriptis reveles.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div5" corresp="regest5">
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z16"/><persName ref="p19065">Princeps Saxonię elector</persName><note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7"><persName ref="p19065">Johann Friedrich I. von Sachsen</persName>.</note> intravit diciones suas recuperaturus atque, <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>ut audio, fere singulas recepit.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p3590">Landgravius</persName><note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8"><persName ref="p3590">Philipp von Hessen</persName>.</note> cum <persName ref="p7459">comite a Buren</persName><note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9"><persName ref="p7459">Maximilian von Egmont</persName>, Graf von <placeName ref="l2126">Büren</placeName>.</note>, <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>qui in agrum <placeName ref="l213">Cattorum</placeName><note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10"><placeName ref="l213">Hessen</placeName>. -Zum Einmarsch <persName ref="p7459">von Bürens</persName> in <placeName ref="l213">Hessen</placeName> im Dezember 1546 s. <bibl source="b21">HBBW XVIII</bibl> 375, Anm. 21; <bibl source="b480">PC</bibl> IVII, Nr. 519 (Brief <persName ref="p3590">Philipps von Hessen</persName> vom 7. Januar 1547).</note> irrupit, negotium habet.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Qua autem fortuna utatur, <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>nescio.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Nullas enim amplius literas a nostris principibus habere possumus; <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>adeo omnes vię sunt perclusę!</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div6" corresp="regest6">
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8018">Hallerus</persName> valet et est multum <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>sollicitus.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Ego ipsum solor, quantum possum.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Si domino ita visum esset, <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>ut ego cum vestris concionatoribus<note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11">Gemeint sind die aus <placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName> stammenden, in <placeName ref="l18">Augsburg</placeName> wirkenden Pfarrer <persName ref="p8018">Johannes Haller</persName>, <persName ref="p8130">Lorenz Meyer (Agricola)</persName>, <persName ref="p2812">(Hans) Thoman Ruman (Römer)</persName> und <persName ref="p6544">Rudolf Schwyzer d.Ä.</persName></note>, quando contingeret magistratum nostrum <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>impias conditiones cum <persName ref="p18538">cesare</persName><note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" n="12"><persName ref="p18538">Karl V.</persName></note> inire (quod deus avertat)<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a"><hi>Klammern ergänzt.</hi></note>, <placeName ref="l587">Tigurum</placeName> concederem <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>exulatum,<note xml:id="fn13" type="footnote" n="13">Vgl. dazu auch <persName ref="p8018">Hallers</persName> Bemerkung in <ref target="file12793">Nr. 2744</ref>,53-55.</note> bene mecum comparatum esse censerem.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div7" corresp="regest7">
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Vale et dicito ex me <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>salutem omnibus bonis et piis.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">6. ianuarii 1547.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z26"/>Tuus <persName ref="p8354">Georgius Lętus</persName>, etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="de"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Herrn <persName ref="p495">Henrichen Bullinger</persName>, etc., <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>vorgeern<note xml:id="fn14" type="footnote" ana="lex" n="14">Antistes.</note> der kirchen <placeName ref="l587">Zurch</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>mynem gunnstigen herrn <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>und brudern.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="de"><placeName ref="l587">Zurch</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z5"/>Cito.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
</TEI>